Modifications made by smartmacherei relative to the upstream PyLoxone project
(see git history for details):

  * Physical device topology: the full Miniserver program (sps*.LoxCC) is
    downloaded and decoded (LZ4) to group entities under their real physical
    Loxone device (TreeDevice) instead of one HA device per control.
    (custom_components/loxone/topology.py, helpers.py, __init__.py)
  * Auto-discovery of physical terminals that are not exposed in the Loxone
    visualization ("Visu"), injected as entities and grouped by device.
  * device_class / icon mapping: sensor units (incl. "°"->°C, "Lx"->lx,
    case-insensitive matching) and binary-sensor name keywords
    (motion / presence / window / ...). (sensor.py, binary_sensor.py)
  * HTTP initial-value seeding for values the Miniserver does not push over
    the WebSocket stream (config analog values).
